msgstr "Exit"

msgid "Fixed Delay"
msgstr "固定遅延"

msgid "On: the delay is in seconds. Off: normalized time of the state."
msgstr "ON: 遅延を秒で解釈します。OFF: State の正規化時間で解釈します。"

